---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../../components/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Calacatta White Marble | Italian Marble for Custom Stone Products"
  description="Explore Calacatta white marble for custom stone sinks, vanities, tables and luxury interiors. Discover natural veining, surface finishes and bespoke fabrication options."
>
  <section class="material-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/materials/">Materials</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Calacatta White Marble</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="material-hero-grid">
        <div class="material-content">
          <h1>Calacatta</h1>

          <p>
            Calacatta marble is a premium natural stone valued for its
            luminous white background and distinctive gray veining. The
            contrast, movement and distribution of its natural patterns give
            each slab an individual character, making it a popular choice for
            statement interiors and bespoke stone products.
          </p>

          <p>
            For custom stone furniture and bathroom projects, Calacatta marble
            can be fabricated into vessel sinks, vanity tops, dining tables,
            coffee tables and other made-to-order pieces. Material selection,
            vein direction, dimensions and surface finish can be coordinated
            with the intended design.
          </p>

          <div class="material-hero-actions">
            <Button href="/contact/">Request a Quote</Button>

            <a
              href="https://wa.me/8613927192948"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="whatsapp-button"
            >
              Chat on WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="material-image">
          <img
            src="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-hero.jpg"
            alt="Calacatta white marble slab with natural gray veining"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="variation-notice">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="variation-box">
        <div class="variation-icon">✦</div>

        <div class="variation-content">
          <h2>Natural Marble Variation</h2>

          <p>
            Calacatta marble is a natural material. Veining, background
            tone and pattern distribution vary between slabs, so the finished
            product may not look exactly like a reference photograph.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Natural variation in gray veining and pattern movement</li>
            <li>Differences in white background tone and mineral details</li>
            <li>Vein direction can be considered during fabrication planning</li>
            <li>Reference images are examples, not a guarantee of an identical slab</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="material-characteristics">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Calacatta Characteristics</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        The appeal of Calacatta white marble comes from its natural pattern,
        bright appearance and potential for carefully designed custom
        applications.
      </p>

      <div class="characteristics-list">
        <div class="characteristic-item">
          <div class="characteristic-icon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3>White Background and Gray Veining</h3>
            <p>
              White and gray tones create a refined natural-stone appearance
              that works with a range of contemporary and classic interiors.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="characteristic-item">
          <div class="characteristic-icon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Individual Natural Patterns</h3>
            <p>
              Every slab has its own veining and visual movement, allowing
              designers to select patterns that suit a particular project.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="characteristic-item">
          <div class="characteristic-icon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Suitable for Bespoke Products</h3>
            <p>
              With appropriate material selection and fabrication, Calacatta
              marble can be made into custom sinks, vanity tops and statement
              furniture.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="characteristic-item">
          <div class="characteristic-icon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Design-Led Vein Planning</h3>
            <p>
              Slab selection and cutting plans can take vein direction,
              visible edges and the overall product silhouette into account.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="characteristic-item">
          <div class="characteristic-icon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Multiple Surface Finish Options</h3>
            <p>
              Polished and honed finishes are common options, subject to the
              selected stone and the requirements of the finished product.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="characteristic-item">
          <div class="characteristic-icon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Custom Dimensions and Details</h3>
            <p>
              Product dimensions, edge profiles, cut-outs and selected design
              details can be discussed according to drawings and project needs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="material-specifications">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="spec-layout">
        <div class="surface-finishes">
          <h2>Available Surface Finishes</h2>

          <p>
            The finish affects the way Calacatta marble reflects light and
            presents its natural veining. Availability should be confirmed
            against the selected slab and intended application.
          </p>

          <div class="finish-list">
            <div class="finish-item">
              <h3>Polished</h3>
              <p>
                A smooth, reflective finish that emphasizes color contrast
                and the visual depth of the marble pattern.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="finish-item">
              <h3>Honed</h3>
              <p>
                A smooth, low-sheen finish that creates a softer and more
                understated stone appearance.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="finish-item">
              <h3>Custom Finish</h3>
              <p>
                Other finish requirements can be reviewed according to the
                stone characteristics, product design and practical use.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="material-specs">
          <h2>Material Specifications</h2>

          <div class="spec-table">
            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Material Type</span>
              <strong>Natural Marble</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Visual Appearance</span>
              <strong>White Background with Natural Gray Veining</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Origin</span>
              <strong>Italy</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Available Finishes</span>
              <strong>Polished, Honed and Confirmed Custom Options</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Thickness</span>
              <strong>Confirm by Product Design</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Customization</span>
              <strong>Available for Suitable Products</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-row">
              <span>Applications</span>
              <strong>Sinks, Vanity Tops, Tables and Interior Details</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="project-gallery">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Calacatta Gallery</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        Explore the natural veining, surface details and possible applications
        of Calacatta white marble. Final appearance depends on the selected slab
        and fabrication plan.
      </p>

      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <a
          href="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-slab.jpg"
          class="gallery-item glightbox"
          aria-label="View Calacatta white marble slab"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-slab.jpg"
            alt="Calacatta white marble slab with gray natural veining"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>

        <a
          href="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-bathroom.jpg"
          class="gallery-item glightbox"
          aria-label="View Calacatta marble bathroom application"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-bathroom.jpg"
            alt="Calacatta white marble in a bathroom interior"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>

        <a
          href="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-spiral-staircase.jpg"
          class="gallery-item glightbox"
          aria-label="View Calacatta marble custom project application"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-spiral-staircase.jpg"
            alt="Custom stone product made with Calacatta white marble"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>

         <a
          href="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-vessel-sink.jpg"
          class="gallery-item glightbox"
          aria-label="View Calacatta marble custom project application"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/details/calacatta/calacatta-vessel-sink.jpg"
            alt="Custom vessel sink made with Calacatta white marble"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alternative-materials">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Explore Other Materials</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        Comparing different marble patterns can help you choose a material
        that fits your design direction, color palette and project requirements.
      </p>

      <div class="alternative-grid">
        <a
          href="/materials/calacatta-viola/"
          class="alternative-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/library/calacatta-viola.jpg"
            alt="Calacatta Viola marble with dramatic burgundy veining"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <h3>Calacatta Viola</h3>

          <p>
            A distinctive marble known for its dramatic burgundy and purple
            veining.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/materials/"
          class="alternative-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/library/panda-white.jpg"
            alt="Panda White marble with contrasting black and white patterns"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <h3>Panda White</h3>

          <p>
            A bold black-and-white appearance for statement interiors.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/materials/"
          class="alternative-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/materials/library/volakas-white.jpg"
            alt="Volakas white marble with soft gray veining"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <h3>Volakas White</h3>

          <p>
            A light marble appearance with softer gray veining.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="recommended-applications">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Calacatta Applications</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        Calacatta white marble can be considered for selected bathroom,
        furniture and interior projects. Product design should account for
        the characteristics of natural marble and the demands of the intended use.
      </p>

      <div class="applications-grid">
        <a
          href="/stone-sinks/"
          class="application-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/products/stone-sinks/custom-italian-calacatta-white-marble-vessel-sink-integrated-handles/marble-vessel-sink-with-handles.jpg"
            alt="Custom natural stone sinks"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <div class="application-content">
            <h3>Stone Sinks</h3>
            <p>
              Custom vessel sinks and other stone sink designs for distinctive
              bathroom interiors.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/stone-tables/"
          class="application-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/categories/stone-tables-hero.jpg"
            alt="Custom natural stone dining and coffee tables"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <div class="application-content">
            <h3>Stone Tables</h3>
            <p>
              Bespoke dining tables, coffee tables and statement furniture.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/custom-stone-furniture/"
          class="application-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/categories/custom-stone-furniture-hero.jpg"
            alt="Custom stone furniture for residential and commercial projects"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <div class="application-content">
            <h3>Custom Stone Furniture</h3>
            <p>
              Made-to-order stone pieces developed around your drawings
              and design requirements.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/oem-odm/"
          class="application-card"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/oem/projects/oem-furniture.jpg"
            alt="Custom Calacatta marble product fabrication"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <div class="application-content">
            <h3>OEM &amp; ODM</h3>
            <p>
              Discuss custom product development, material selection and
              fabrication requirements with our team.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="material-faq">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        Common questions about Calacatta white marble, finishes and custom
        stone fabrication.
      </p>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What is Calacatta white marble?</summary>
          <p>
  
            Calacatta is a marble category commonly associated with a white
            background and distinctive natural veining. The exact pattern,
            color balance and visual character vary by slab and material selection.
            
            For a comparison of white marble options, read our <a href="/blog/carrara-white-marble-buying-guide/">
              **Carrara White Marble Buying Guide**
            </a>
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Is Calacatta white marble the same as Carrara marble?</summary>
          <p>
            No. Calacatta and Carrara are different marble varieties with
            distinct visual characteristics, although their appearance can
            overlap. Comparing actual slabs is the best way to evaluate
            background tone, vein pattern and overall contrast.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can Calacatta marble be used for custom vessel sinks?</summary>
          <p>

            It may be suitable for custom vessel sinks when the selected
            material, design and fabrication method meet the product's
            requirements. The stone's natural characteristics and intended
            use should be reviewed before production.
            
            Explore our <a href="/stone-sinks/custom-italian-calacatta-white-marble-vessel-sink-integrated-handles/">
            ** Custom Calacatta Marble Vessel Sink**
            </a>
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Which finishes are available for Calacatta marble?</summary>
          <p>
            Polished and honed finishes are common options. Other finishes
            depend on the selected stone, fabrication capabilities and
            intended application.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I customize the dimensions and design?</summary>
          <p>
            Yes. For suitable products, dimensions, profiles and design details
            can be discussed based on drawings, reference images or project
            specifications.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Will my finished product match the reference image exactly?</summary>
          <p>
            Not necessarily. Natural marble varies in veining, color and
            pattern distribution. If a particular appearance is important,
            slab selection and vein planning should be discussed before fabrication.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="material-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Planning a Custom Calacatta Marble Project?</h2>

      <p>
        Share your product idea, dimensions, drawings or reference images.
        Our team can help review material options and coordinate custom
        stone fabrication requirements.
      </p>

      <Button href="/contact/">Request a Quote</Button>

      <a
        href="https://wa.me/8613927192948"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="whatsapp-button"
      >
        Chat on WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
